# Terraform's working directories and any local state stay out of git: the environments keep their state in the S3
# bucket infra/bootstrap creates, and the bootstrap's own state stays with the owner (doc/deploy.md). The provider lock
# files (.terraform.lock.hcl) are committed.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Variable files carry the owner's values (the budget and alarm emails, the image digest): they are passed on the
# command line or kept in a local file, never committed.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
